('prod_03','IF-RG-003','nordic-loom-hand-tufted-wool-rug','Nordic Loom Hand-Tufted Wool & Jute Rug (8x10 ft)','High-pile organic New Zealand wool blended with raw organic jute. Subtle architectural low-relief carved geometric ribs that add quiet acoustic dampening.','rugs',3400000,5,true,'240cm x 300cm (8ft x 10ft)','70% New Zealand Wool, 30% Raw Jute',null,false,'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600121848594-d8644e57abab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80',array['https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600121848594-d8644e57abab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80']::text[],'2026-09-05T10:00:00+00:00','2026-10-05T10:00:00+00:00'),
